Activity Board package

The desktop implementation was extracted from the Progress package at
sailry-plugins 6127373f6b8c0294fe0efb5e3ec8c7b249c0cc56.
It is adapted from Sailry ef5e82ea, desktop/activity/{board,cards,projects}.rs,
